    | Origination Date | At origination Date | ceOriginationDate | Date | Yes | Yes | Yes | | to be manually filled by user |
    | Ebitda | Accounting EBITDA | ceAccountingEbitda | BigDecimal | Yes | Yes | Yes | FINANCIALS/ebitda | Get EBITDA from financial table / numeric / editable |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 1 (wording in comment) | ceAdjustment1 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 2 (wording in comment) | ceAdjustment2 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 3 (wording in comment) | ceAdjustment3 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 4 (wording in comment) | ceAdjustment4 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 5 (wording in comment) | ceAdjustment5 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 6 (wording in comment) | ceAdjustment6 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 7 (wording in comment) | ceAdjustment7 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 8 (wording in comment) | ceAdjustment8 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    |<#DBEAFE> Ebitda |<#DBEAFE> **Adjusted EBITDA** |<#DBEAFE> ceAdjustedEbitda |<#DBEAFE> BigDecimal |<#DBEAFE> Yes |<#DBEAFE> Yes |<#DBEAFE> No |<#DBEAFE> CALC/ceAdjustedEbitda |<#DBEAFE> ceAccountingEbitda + ceAdjustment1..ceAdjustment8 |
    | Gross Debt | Committed Loan Facility | committedLoanFacility | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Gross Debt | Committed LC Facility | committedLCFacility | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Gross Debt | Funded debt on \nuncommitted loan facilities | fundedDebtOnUncommittedLoanFacilities | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Gross Debt | Outstanding amounts on \nuncommitted LC facilities | outstandingAmountsOnUncommittedLCFacilities | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Gross Debt | Other Financial Commitments | otherFinancialCommitments | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    |<#DBEAFE> Gross Debt |<#DBEAFE> **Total Committed Debt** |<#DBEAFE> totalCommittedDebt |<#DBEAFE> BigDecimal |<#DBEAFE> No |<#DBEAFE> Yes |<#DBEAFE> No |<#DBEAFE> CALC/totalCommittedDebt |<#DBEAFE> loan + LC + uncommitted loan + uncommitted LC + other |
    | Gross Debt | o/w Non recourse debt | ceNonRecourseDebt | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Gross Debt | o/w Qualifying Subordinated Debt | qualifyingSubordinatedDebt | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    |<#DBEAFE> Gross Debt |<#DBEAFE> **Total Committed Debt Per Definition** |<#DBEAFE> ceTotalCommittedDebtPerDefinition |<#DBEAFE> BigDecimal |<#DBEAFE> Yes |<#DBEAFE> Yes |<#DBEAFE> No |<#DBEAFE> CALC/ceTotalCommittedDebtPerDefinition |<#DBEAFE> totalCommittedDebt - ceNonRecourseDebt - qualifyingSubordinatedDebt |
    |<#DBEAFE> Gross Debt |<#DBEAFE> **Total Committed Debt Per Definition / Adj. EBITDA** \n **(FED leverage ratio)** |<#DBEAFE> ceFedLeverageRatio |<#DBEAFE> BigDecimal |<#DBEAFE> Yes |<#DBEAFE> Yes |<#DBEAFE> No |<#DBEAFE> CALC/ceFedLeverageRatio |<#DBEAFE> ceTotalCommittedDebtPerDefinition / ceAdjustedEbitda  [fillsFlag: fedLeverageRatio] |
    | Gross Debt | Threshold per policy based on Sector | ceThresholdPerPolicyBasedOnSector | string | Yes | Yes | No | | display x4 if Q_MI_01 = General Obligor; display x6 if Q_MI_01 = Utilities |
    | Gross Debt | Threshold for Escalation | escalationThreshold | BigDecimal | Yes | Yes | No | | display x6; display x7 if Q-MI01 = Utilities |
  end note

  note as GENERAL_OBLIGOR_AND_UTILITIES_FINANCIAL_TABLE_2
