    Low / Risk Assessment: done at Credit Event and each AR / LTM Data for high/low risk decision)

    <#E8F1FB,#1D4E89>|= Section |= Label |= Field Key |= Type |= Mandatory |= Visible |= Editable|= Derived From |= Business rule |
    | Origination Date | At origination Date | raOriginationDate | Date | Yes | Yes | Yes | | to be manually filled by user |
    | Ebitda | Accounting EBITDA | raAccountingEbitda | BigDecimal | Yes | Yes | Yes | FINANCIALS/ebitda | Get EBITDA from financial table / numeric / editable |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 1 (wording in comment) | raAdjustment1 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 2 (wording in comment) | raAdjustment2 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 3 (wording in comment) | raAdjustment3 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 4 (wording in comment) | raAdjustment4 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 5 (wording in comment) | raAdjustment5 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 6 (wording in comment) | raAdjustment6 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 7 (wording in comment) | raAdjustment7 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Ebitda | Adjustment 8 (wording in comment) | raAdjustment8 | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    |<#DBEAFE> Ebitda |<#DBEAFE> **Adjusted EBITDA** |<#DBEAFE> raAdjustedEbitda |<#DBEAFE> BigDecimal |<#DBEAFE> Yes |<#DBEAFE> Yes |<#DBEAFE> No |<#DBEAFE> CALC/raAdjustedEbitda |<#DBEAFE> raAccountingEbitda + raAdjustment1..raAdjustment8 |
    | Gross Debt | Total B/S debt | totalBSDebt | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Gross Debt | Non recourse Debt | raNonRecourseDebt | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Gross Debt | Highly Secured \n Portion of Gross Funded Debt | highlySecuredGrossFundedDebt | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | Gross Debt | Qualifying Funded \nSubordinated Debt | qualifyingFundedSubordinatedDebt | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | <#DBEAFE> Gross Debt | <#DBEAFE> **Adj. Gross Funded Total Debt** | <#DBEAFE> adjustedGrossFundedTotalDebt | <#DBEAFE> BigDecimal | <#DBEAFE> Yes | <#DBEAFE> Yes | <#DBEAFE> No | <#DBEAFE> CALC/adjustedGrossFundedTotalDebt | <#DBEAFE> totalBSDebt - raNonRecourseDebt \n - highlySecuredGrossFundedDebt - qualifyingFundedSubordinatedDebt |
    | Gross Debt | Cash | cash | BigDecimal | No | Yes | Yes | | Numeric value to be inserted |
    | <#DBEAFE> Gross Debt | <#DBEAFE> **Adj. Net Funded Total Debt** | <#DBEAFE> adjustedFundedTotalDebt | <#DBEAFE> BigDecimal | <#DBEAFE> Yes | <#DBEAFE> Yes | <#DBEAFE> No | <#DBEAFE> CALC/adjustedFundedTotalDebt | <#DBEAFE> adjustedGrossFundedTotalDebt - cash |
